  data: {
    LLM: "Players bid in order from dealer's left; lowest bid 7, highest Boom (13). Pass or bid higher; once you pass you may not bid again. When three have passed, dealer must bid 7, bid Boom, or declare Meetje. Highest bidder leads to the first trick; the suit of that card is trump. Each trick: follow suit if possible; no obligation to beat or trump when void. Trick won by highest trump in it, or highest of led suit if no trump. Winner of each trick leads to the next. After 13 tricks, score by bid and tricks won; then next hand or end of round.",
    Player: "Players bid in order from dealer's left; lowest bid 7, highest Boom (13). Pass or bid higher; once you pass you may not bid again. When three have passed, dealer must bid 7, bid Boom, or declare Meetje. Highest bidder leads to the first trick; the suit of that card is trump. Each trick: follow suit if possible; no obligation to beat or trump when void. Trick won by highest trump in it, or highest of led suit if no trump. Winner of each trick leads to the next. After 13 tricks, score by bid and tricks won; then next hand or end of round.",
    objective: "Win tricks according to your team's bid, or prevent the opposing team from making theirs.",
    gameplay: "Players bid in order from dealer's left; lowest bid 7, highest Boom (13). Pass or bid higher; once you pass you may not bid again. When three have passed, dealer must bid 7, bid Boom, or declare Meetje. Highest bidder leads to the first trick; the suit of that card is trump. Each trick: follow suit if possible; no obligation to beat or trump when void. Trick won by highest trump in it, or highest of led suit if no trump. Winner of each trick leads to the next. After 13 tricks, score by bid and tricks won; then next hand or end of round.",
    keyRules: [
      'Bid a number of tricks (7-13); highest bidder picks trump by leading.',
